<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT- Prudential boosts IBM target.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT- Prudential boosts IBM target.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Prudential Securities analyst Don Young raised his 12-month price target on International Business Machines Corp to $185 to $190 from his previous target of $160, his office said.</p>
<p>-- The analyst maintained his buy rating and left his earnings estimates unchanged at $4.10 per share for the fourth quarter, $13.25 per share for the 1997 year and $15.50 per share for 1998, his office said.</p>
<p>-- The analyst was not immediately available to comment further.</p>
<p>-- E. Auchard, Wall Street bureau, 212-859-1736</p>
</text>
